OL,3,GNEWSACyclist left seriously hurt in
OL,4,Ahit-and-run crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyclist has been left seriously
OL,7,Finjured after being struck by a car in
OL,8,Fa hit-and-run.
OL,10,FPolice, who were called at about 05:25
OL,11,FBST, said they found a car abandoned at
OL,12,Fthe scene, at the junction of Cattell
OL,13,FRoad and Templefield Street, in Small
OL,14,FHeath, Birmingham. The driver is
OL,15,Fthought to have fled on foot.
OL,17,FAn investigation has been launched to
OL,18,Ftrack down the driver and West Midlands
OL,19,FPolice has urged anyone with
OL,20,Finformation to contact the force.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
