OL,3,GNEWSACyclist left seriously hurt in
OL,4,Ahit-and-run crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cyclist remains in a serious
OL,7,Fcondition in hospital, officers have
OL,8,Fsaid. Cattell Road, near the Birmingham
OL,9,FCity FC stadium, has been shut. Police
OL,10,Fare examining CCTV footage and speaking
OL,11,Fto witnesses.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
